  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gingerbread cookies royal icing bring instant holiday cheer, filling your kitchen with warm spice and sweet nostalgia as the cutouts bake. Once cooled, a smooth royal icing sweetened with maple syrup gives you the perfect canvas for snowflakes, stars, and cheerful little characters. Natural color powders like beet or spinach add a festive pop, turning each cookie into edible art. Invite kids to help with the decorating, pour a mug of spiced apple cider, and let gingerbread cookies royal icing make every gathering feel extra merry.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-gingerbread-cookies-royal-icing\">Why You’ll Love This Gingerbread cookies royal icing</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-gingerbread-cookies-royal-icing\">How to Make Gingerbread Cookies Royal Icing</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-gingerbread-cookies-royal-icing\">Pro Tips for Making Gingerbread Cookies Royal Icing</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-gingerbread-cookies-royal-icing\">How to Serve this Gingerbread cookies royal icing</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-gingerbread-cookies-royal-icing\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Gingerbread cookies royal icing</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Deliciously spiced flavor that warms your heart.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fun to decorate, making it a perfect family activity.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sturdy enough for intricate designs with royal icing.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for gifting or holiday parties, spreading joy.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-contain